    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "What is the difficulty of releasing a portable version of qTox?\nI found version 1.17.6 on the page https://portableapps.com/apps/internet/qtox-portable\nHowever, it was updated on 2022-08-28. It would be great if the developers implemented the release of a portable version of qTox, so as not to search for them on other, including questionable sites.\nThank you very much!",
    "closed_at": null,
    "closed_by": null,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> What is the difficulty of releasing a portable version of qTox?\n\nNo difficulty what so ever. qTox has a portable mode, which you can either activate in settings, or by supplying the `--portable` argument to the exe.\n",
