            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "I run `setup-qtox-x86_64-release.exe --portable`, but instead of launching portable mode, a window appears to install qtox in the C:\\Program files folder.\n\n<img width=\"935\" height=\"485\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59d53044-fb7e-4bcb-adbf-fe18afdc8f58\" />\n\nPerhaps I expressed myself incorrectly; I need a version of qtox that can be run from a flash drive, without installing it on the computer and without leaving traces in the registry or other folders other than the folder from which qtox was launched.",
