        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks, I've started to understand now.\nNow I'm running `qtox.exe --portable %cd%`\nAnd the program works as portable\n\nNevertheless, it would be great if you had the opportunity to publish portable versions separately, it would simplify updating the program (this time I did the installation in vmware and moved the program folder to a real machine).",
